{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208310","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120831001:1":{"text":"중화제를 구한 것 같군요. 그러면 약을 시험해 보겠습니다.","source_cn":"看来几位已经找到了中和剂，那么，请允许我验药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2C56D0A75876EAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120831002:1":{"text":"약효가 아주 좋군요.","source_cn":"恭喜各位，药效很好，检验无误。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CBB86AFA2BB8BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120831003:1":{"text":"아까 의뢰는 3개가 있다고 했죠? 그럼 세 번째는 뭔가요?","source_cn":"之前说有三项考验，那么，第三项是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55F8D8E261E81174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120831004:1":{"text":"세 번째는 내가 발표하도록 하지.","source_cn":"第三道考验，就由我来公布吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41DD7FC512F48E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1120831004":{"text":"세 번째는 내가 발표하도록 하지.","source_cn":"第三道考验，就由我来公布吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41DD7FC512F48E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10: